有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1611_p0835a01","n":"0835a","t":"為自利益善起精進為利益他"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1611_p0835b01","n":"0835b","t":"離無明住地所攝故若如是者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1611_p0835c01","n":"0835c","t":"義故六根聚經言世尊六根如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1611_p0836a01","n":"0836a","t":"止息故造作化城如來如是於"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1611_p0836b01","n":"0836b","t":"張疊與是諸人而告之言凡能"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1611_p0836c01","n":"0836c","t":"無差涅槃界日相似相對此偈"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1611_p0837a01","n":"0837a","t":"究竟一乘寶性論卷第四後魏"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1611_p0837b01","n":"0837b","t":"上妙寶像等如來藏相似此偈"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1611_p0837c01","n":"0837c","t":"煩惱能作福業罪業行緣但能"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1611_p0838a01","n":"0838a","t":"此九種貪等煩惱於萎華等九"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1611_p0838b01","n":"0838b","t":"此偈明何義謂依法身自性清"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1611_p0838c01","n":"0838c","t":"此偈明何義諸佛美蜜及堅固"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1611_p0839a01","n":"0839a","t":"佛性有二種一者如地藏二者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1611_p0839b01","n":"0839b","t":"諸道者如聖者勝鬘經言世尊"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1611_p0839c01","n":"0839c","t":"謂聲聞辟支佛人以彼聲聞辟"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1611_p0840a01","n":"0840a","t":"巧出寶珠所謂我想常樂淨想"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1611_p0840b01","n":"0840b","t":"滅唯佛得證壞一切煩惱藏修"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1611_p0840c01","n":"0840c","t":"皆有如來性而不說空寂以有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1611_p0841a01","n":"0841a","t":"論曰已說有垢如自此以下說"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1611_p0841b01","n":"0841b","t":"說三偈向說佛法身自性清淨"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1611_p0841c01","n":"0841c","t":"寶藏大果樹無垢真金像轉輪"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1611_p0842a01","n":